  "releaseNotes": "AsyncWebhookResultDTO adds an optional ExternalReferences list, so one result can report the ids several of your systems assigned to an incident (for example a CAD incident number and an ePCR run number). Each entry names its system and is recorded once per incident, agency and system. The existing ExternalSystemIncidentId and ExternalSystemId fields are unchanged. The change is additive.",
